  <section class="studio-story section-pad"><p class="eyebrow">OUR ROOTS</p><div><h2>A decade in Lahore.<br>A lifetime in the <em>details.</em></h2><p>Archcell is an architecture and interior design practice with ten years of experience and hundreds of projects, mainly residential. Our work begins with the everyday life a building will hold.</p><p>We think about the way a family gathers, how daylight moves through a room, and where someone might find a quiet moment. From the street-facing elevation to the final working drawing, those small decisions shape the whole.</p><div class="large-stats"><div><strong>10+</strong><span>Years of experience</span></div><div><strong>100s</strong><span>Projects imagined & built</span></div><div><strong>LHR</strong><span>Our home, our perspective</span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="values-section section-pad"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT GUIDES US</p><h2>Less noise.<br><em>More meaning.</em></h2></div></div><div class="value-grid"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>People before plans.</h3><p>We begin with how you live: your needs, your habits, and what home means to you.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Context over convention.</h3><p>A home belongs to its site, its climate and its neighbourhood. The design should recognise all three.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Every detail belongs.</h3><p>Architecture, interiors and technical drawings work together as parts of one considered whole.</p></article></div></section>
